{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act38side_level_act38side_st02",
  "groupId": "act38side",
  "stageId": "act38side_st02",
  "title": "《復仇禁制令》",
  "storyCode": "PV-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "98aca92bcaf4ca58770efc6a0e1d93b8feac6c7aa79e83ef01678efd1d3ee365",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g5_srcpark"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東尼奧先生，我已經幫法布里齊奧先生量好尺寸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "店裡正好就有他想要的布料，只要趕一下，這套衣服就能如期做好，不會耽誤你們的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……爸爸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（點頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就趕快帶著盧奇諾先回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爺爺，這些人根本不打算放我們走……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無妨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們放心走就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗女士，那你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕我得留下處理一些家族事務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東，你應該明白老爺的意思了，讓你的人撤走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能這麼處理，爸爸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "翁貝托已經向我保證過了。客人總不能一直留在家裡，安東。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，英格麗，你這樣做，確實讓我們很難堪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們活著對我很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（走。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，英格麗，自從我到了新沃爾西尼之後，就一直盼著能和你見上一面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但不該是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "威尼斯自家人的刀從不向內。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "56_g3_newvolsiniialley_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳——走吧，盧奇諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟糕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "藥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫您取的藥還在那個房間，還有本來要送的貨……被抓來的時候，他們搜了我的身——爺爺，我、我回去拿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "威尼斯的宅子和德蒙塔諾隔著好幾個街區，還有許多路要走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "盧奇諾回頭看，威尼斯的人沒有從宅子裡追出來。\n老裁縫的手放在了他的肩膀。他清晰地感受到了老人在顫抖，彷彿剛才和老威尼斯的見面已經耗光了他的力氣。\n更要命的是，他發現自己的肩膀原來還這麼瘦弱，如果爺爺真的倒下，自己甚至可能撐不住他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爺爺……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒、沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "盧奇諾有一肚子問題，他問不出口。但他突然想到了一些很模糊的畫面。也是像現在這樣，兩個人走在一條同樣陌生的路上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三歲，還是四歲？\n載具經過農莊，老人從上面跳下來，沒有站穩，踉蹌著摔倒。\n自己看著他走到面前，盯著他臉上的泥巴，還有他腰間的尺和剪刀，害怕地哭出聲來。老人緊張得手足無措——\n那時他臉上的皺紋要比現在少很多。\n老人牽著自己離開了農莊，路不知道通向哪裡。應該是害怕吧，自己的哭聲越來越大，被吵醒的羽獸扇著翅膀飛遠。\n“別哭別哭，盧奇諾。”\n“翁貝托，說點什麼，說點什麼……爺爺跟你講一個童話故事吧……”\n“每一位獵人進入荒野前都會遇見狼。”\n“狼說，柘木做的弓很堅韌，石頭磨出的刀很鋒利，但想要活下來，就脫下你們為保護皮肉而穿上的衣物，唯獨那不屬於荒野……”\n“哈哈，竟然不哭了，你這孩子，竟然喜歡這種故事？爺爺還知道很多……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "56_g3_newvolsiniialley_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爺爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1543_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧奇諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4155_talr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您能再教我縫一遍扣子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g7_reception"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很開心你願意聽我這個老傢伙的建議，留下敘敘舊，英格麗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本以為你會像當初那樣，握著刀，頭也不回地離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也以為，遠走東國會讓我平靜下來。但您也看到了，我逃不開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "踏進這裡的時候，我就沒有想過能那麼輕鬆地離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗，你一定要走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以試著攔住我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺說得對，威尼斯自家人的刀從不向內。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沃爾珀摸出了一件隨身攜帶的東西。\n安東尼奧很清楚那是什麼——家徽，當年他決定跟隨法布里齊奧時，拿到了同樣的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你決定了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原諒我，老爺。我有一種預感，接下來我要做的事您不會贊同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果這個家徽成了我解決心結的阻礙，我也別無他法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這很自私，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g5_srcpark"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，你為什麼用石頭砸我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔強的小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誤傷，是誤傷。我本來是要砸那幾個逃走的傢伙，你、你正好經過……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你臉上的傷……是剛剛那些孩子弄的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔強的小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們說我的耳朵很大很奇怪，說我不是魯珀，不配待在敘拉古。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔強的小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒看見他們傷得更重嗎？打不過我，光是嘴巴會說有什麼用，下次我要把他們的牙都拔掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，那你可比他們像魯珀多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的家人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔強的小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……死了。我們逃難來到這裡，爸爸媽媽去市政府申請救濟，正好遇上了一場幫派鬥毆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒有地方可去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔強的小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你願意跟我走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔強的小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你需要我替你打架嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這個等你長大一點再說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的女兒貝拉，身體不太好，平常不怎麼出門，正好缺一個玩伴……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔強的小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要她願意和沃爾珀玩，我無所謂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼乾脆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔強的小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我力氣還小，一直待在公園，打不過所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿著這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔強的小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "威尼斯的家徽。接下它，意味著我們成為了一家人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔強的小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……但我不是魯珀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的家裡很多人都不是魯珀，但我們的聯繫比其他任何一個家族都要緊密。你以後也會懂的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g4_srctheater"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別藏在媽媽的腿後面啦，身體可以遮住，但我已經看見你的尾巴啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯怯的小女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是麗薩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這孩子和你小時候完全不一樣，英格麗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起。沒有提前通知您就把她帶了回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "神社那群老古董發現了這孩子，我不能讓她繼續留在東國。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為所謂的九尾血脈，就得一輩子待在神社裡，和她爸爸那樣，被人像個有求必應的吉祥物一樣供著，太蠢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的房間已經收拾出來了。等到適應敘拉古的生活後，可以讓她和家族的其他孩子一起上學。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺，我希望麗薩離東國那一套遠一點，但也不想讓她學習所謂敘拉古的生存之道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去跟安東打個招呼吧，幫這孩子請個專門的老師，音樂、文學、繪畫、星象、源石技藝……她喜歡什麼就學什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不怪我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還在我面前，英格麗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你出刀的手有變慢嗎？你執行的任務有變少嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你就依然是家族裡最適合接過我擔子的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說，我很喜歡這個孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以當務之急是，怎麼讓她不怕我，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g11_mansionhall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是沒有結果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我挑斷了那個傢伙手腳和尾巴處的筋，但他到死也不肯吐出到底是誰策劃了那起刺殺，只是一直說什麼也不知道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和之前那十七個人一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……麗薩剛剛睡著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這孩子的感染情況很嚴重，源石結晶已經蔓延到了肩膀，您沒必要親自照顧她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我做了防護。再說，麗薩是因為我才受的傷。英格麗，你對此什麼都沒有說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麗薩是個單純的孩子，她不知道這段時間外面發生了多麼可怕的事情，只是本能地察覺到了宅子裡的人都很緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你去救安東尼奧的時候，她想說待在我身邊，你就能少擔心一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島的人已經到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……原來你早就為麗薩找好了去處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家族可以在敘拉古境內為麗薩找到最好的礦石病醫生，你沒必要瞞著我私下聯絡那家叫羅德島的公司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……英格麗，你們沒必要離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "西西里夫人明天就會親自到達特爾尼城，唐克雷蒂家族與威尼斯家族不得不坐在談判桌上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個時候，您必須將我從家族中除名，就像唐克雷蒂的人到死都不會承認他們策劃了直接針對您的刺殺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得這個話題我們已經聊過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起，老爺。家徽還給您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留著。英格麗，留著吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我默許了你為麗薩復仇，我喜歡那孩子。不然你以為自己這半個月以來的行動，家族為什麼完全沒有人阻攔你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們是一家人，英格麗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g7_reception"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“我們是一家人。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺，這枚家徽是您的祝福，也是我的枷鎖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……她在羅德島上過得怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麗薩現在算是那家公司的員工，前幾年她還去了趟萊塔尼亞，幫羅德島調查一起和感染者有關的失蹤案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在寄給我的信裡還故意瞞著不說，我後來去看她的時候問了她的朋友，大家都說她表現得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很想麗薩這孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果她願意回來，我不會阻攔……老爺，您很清楚我不是來敘舊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許您當年堅持讓我留下這枚家徽時有很多打算——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "英格麗看了一眼默默站在一旁的安東尼奧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗，留著它吧。爸爸向我提起過，狂歡節結束後，我們可以一起回一趟蒙特盧佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東，現在說這件事還太早。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "西西里夫人或許會鬆口的不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然狂歡節這個曾經令她深惡痛絕的節日都能以另一種形式重新出現在敘拉古，相比之下，英格麗犯下的事情不值一提。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更何況，已經過去了六年。如今的唐克雷蒂家族早已不值得西西里夫人放在心上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這六年的時間，我靠著當年保下來的那最後一家載具工廠，吃掉了唐克雷蒂家族在特爾尼城的全部產業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "西西里夫人看重結果。這就是結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是這麼看的嗎，安東？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，爸爸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東尼奧在您身邊做得很好，如今家裡已經不需要我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東這孩子……貝拉去世後，他對我多少有些戒心，我能感覺到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "貝拉死了，他這個女婿還能有多少價值……他大概是這麼想的，所以一直讓自己忙得像一顆陀螺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸，我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並不希望你有太多壓力。家族的地盤已經足夠大，哪怕在這剛剛建成的新沃爾西尼，威尼斯也有了一定的話語權。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已經做得夠好了，安東。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看著英格麗離開，看著貝拉死去。我真正在意的，是我身邊已經不剩下多少的“家人”……我也是個老人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想再失去你們中的任何一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "英格麗看著眼前確實已經兩鬢斑白的老人，沒有再說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她將家徽放在了桌上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗，你聽到爸爸的話了，至少別是現在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "安東尼奧的話沒有說完，英格麗已經轉過了身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，老爺……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能理解您的苦衷，但……我做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一直以來，除了殺人，我能幫您做的事情並不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個殺手再頂尖，也不可能成為“小威尼斯”。安東尼奧比我更適合這個位置，我的離開不算多大的損失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這六年，您應該早就發現這一點了。在您心裡，您對我是失望的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我又何嘗不是對遲遲找不到麗薩受傷的真相而感到失望呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "礦石病是不治之症。您比誰都清楚，我為什麼回到敘拉古。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "六年前沒有找出來的那個人，我會找到他，然後讓他償命……除此之外，我沒有別的事想做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但丟下家徽，轉身就走，你知道這意味著什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "意味著我有可能站在您的對立面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不保證自己不會傷害家裡人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_4026_vulpis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕這樣，我也會為您留下最後的體面。這是我唯一能答應您的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸爸，我可以再去勸勸她……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人撫摸著手中的家徽，然後小心地放到了自己的懷中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "英格麗的性格，我們都很清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她認定的事是不會輕易更改的。這枚家徽我會替她保管，等她想通了，我會還給她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近你也少露面吧，剛好多在家裡陪陪我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但公司的事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自己找來的人手，難道你自己都信不過他們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我不怎麼插手你在新沃爾西尼的工作，但不代表我對家裡的事一無所知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "翁貝托·德蒙塔諾是我的老朋友，他一向知道分寸，不要再去打擾他們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽到英格麗問你，你查到了麗薩受傷的真相？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一些線索，畢竟時間已經過去太久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎？安東，有些事情的對錯，你大可自己判斷……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老威尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1545_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但一旦涉及家族的面子，想清楚之後再去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g11_mansionhall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1555_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東尼奧，新消息！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1555_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根據卡彭和甘比諾獲得的情報，我們丟掉的那批貨找到了，在港口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1555_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但、但是……被人藏在花車裡燒掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……誰動的手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1555_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不確定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1555_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "警察已經把卡車工會的老大，那個叫“伊雷妮”的人帶走調查了。她……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1544_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
